+| iPad Pro landscape | 1194 x 834 |
+| laptop | 1440 x 900 |
+| desktop wide | 1920 x 1080 |
+
+Plus 200% browser zoom. Encoded in `audit/scripts/runtime-audit.mjs`.
+
+---
+
